{"4041450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ronin Awakening", "steam_appid": 4041450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mystical realm of medieval Japan, a confident young warrior named Takashi Raizen faces a harrowing quest. While defending his village from a ferocious boar-demon, Takashi is cursed and left with no choice but to embark on a journey to the distant western forest. Legends speak of the God of Thunder residing within, a powerful deity who holds the key to defeating the most vicious demon on Earth and breaking the curse that threatens Takashi’s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Takashi travels the captivating landscapes, he becomes entangled in a war between the forest gods and the hideous demon, revealing the depths of his own courage and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat blends precision swordplay with mystical powers granted by the gods, pushing you to master timing, strategy, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, exploration plays a key role. Every corner of the western forest tells a story. Players can forge bonds with benevolent spirits, and unlock forgotten techniques to aid in the fight against overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every choice made, the weight of destiny falls heavier on Takashi’s shoulders. Will you rise as a savior of the land or fall prey to the darkness that seeks to consume it? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Sword Combat</strong> – Master fast-paced melee battles with precise timing, combos, and counterattacks against relentless demonic foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythical Abilities</strong> – Harness the power of ancient deities, unlocking elemental powers and devastating special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World</strong> – Explore dense forests, sacred temples, towering pagodas, and fortified castles inspired by Japanese folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> – Face off against colossal demons and legendary creatures in high-stakes encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth</strong> – Experience a tale of courage, sacrifice, and destiny in a world caught between gods and monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong> – Upgrade your abilities, acquire unique weapons, and shape Takashi’s path to victory.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mystical realm of medieval Japan, a confident young warrior named Takashi Raizen faces a harrowing quest. While defending his village from a ferocious boar-demon, Takashi is cursed and left with no choice but to embark on a journey to the distant western forest. Legends speak of the God of Thunder residing within, a powerful deity who holds the key to defeating the most vicious demon on Earth and breaking the curse that threatens Takashi’s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Takashi travels the captivating landscapes, he becomes entangled in a war between the forest gods and the hideous demon, revealing the depths of his own courage and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat blends precision swordplay with mystical powers granted by the gods, pushing you to master timing, strategy, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, exploration plays a key role. Every corner of the western forest tells a story. Players can forge bonds with benevolent spirits, and unlock forgotten techniques to aid in the fight against overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every choice made, the weight of destiny falls heavier on Takashi’s shoulders. Will you rise as a savior of the land or fall prey to the darkness that seeks to consume it? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.poster.avif?t=1772501156\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.webm?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.mp4?t=1772501156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Sword Combat</strong> – Master fast-paced melee battles with precise timing, combos, and counterattacks against relentless demonic foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythical Abilities</strong> – Harness the power of ancient deities, unlocking elemental powers and devastating special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World</strong> – Explore dense forests, sacred temples, towering pagodas, and fortified castles inspired by Japanese folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> – Face off against colossal demons and legendary creatures in high-stakes encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth</strong> – Experience a tale of courage, sacrifice, and destiny in a world caught between gods and monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong> – Upgrade your abilities, acquire unique weapons, and shape Takashi’s path to victory.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ronin Awakening promises players a visually stunning and emotionally charged experience, as they guide Takashi through a breathtaking world steeped in Japanese folklore, facing formidable enemies and forging alliances with divine entities in a quest for redemption and survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/9d1bce1457ba40071ac094df2b3a0efb1ee407c6/header.jpg?t=1772501156", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/8a776f591bd2a5d24be24b01503d634742126e42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772501156", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/8